{
 "chunk": 18,
 "cat": "jar",
 "items": [
  {
   "i": 1,
   "en": "It's the only target left, so they'll naturally do that anyway, but giving an \"Eliminate\" order will also make them more aggressive.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/tutorial/void.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "en": "Left-click on the Nav Buoy...",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/tutorial/void.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "en": "Let's transfer command to the Hammerhead, so you can pilot it yourself, and play out the rest of the battle.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/tutorial/void.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "en": "Now that the orders are locked in, let's unpause (press ",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/tutorial/void.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "en": "Press ",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/tutorial/void.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "en": "Pressing and holding ",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/tutorial/void.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "en": "Reinforcements",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/tutorial/void.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "en": "Select the Hammerhead...",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/tutorial/void.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "en": "Select the cruiser...",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/tutorial/void.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "en": "Select the destroyer...",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/tutorial/void.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "en": "Show Video Feed",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/tutorial/void.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "en": "Since this is the tutorial and supply costs aren't an issue, let's deploy everything.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/tutorial/void.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "en": "The bonuses these provide are modest, but they add up, especially given that if you don't hold them, the enemy will.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/tutorial/void.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "en": "The enemy cruiser is tough, but relatively harmless - we'd like our ships to focus on the more dangerous enemy first.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/tutorial/void.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "en": "The first thing we want to do is capture some objectives - locations especially suited for the deployment of nav buoys, sensor arrays, or comm relays.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/tutorial/void.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "en": "The tutorial will resume once both objectives are captured.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/tutorial/void.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "en": "To deploy ships, press the \"Reinforcements\" button in the upper right.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/tutorial/void.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "en": "Transfer Command",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/tutorial/void.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "en": "Welcome to the Starsector fleet command tutorial.\n\nLet's get started!",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/tutorial/void.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "en": "You can also exit the feed by pressing ",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/tutorial/void.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "en": "You can also manually assign a ship to perform a task. Select one of the other frigates...",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/tutorial/void.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "en": "You can also press ESCAPE to leave the tutorial.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/tutorial/void.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "en": "You can exit the feed at any time by pressing ESCAPE.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/tutorial/void.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "en": "You can keep an eye on what each ship is doing by clicking on it and selecting \"Show Video Feed\".",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/tutorial/void.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "en": "You might have noticed that you're not directly controlling a ship at the moment. This can happen if you don't deploy your flagship, or if your flagship is destroyed.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/tutorial/void.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "en": "command point",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/tutorial/void.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "en": "deployment points",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/tutorial/void.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "en": " DEPLOY\nLEFT",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/ui/B/new.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "en": "DEPLOY",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/ui/B/new.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "en": "DEPLOY\n  RIGHT",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/ui/B/new.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "en": "Deploy\n  x",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/ui/B/new.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "en": " points: ",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/ui/d$1.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "en": "Industries: ",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/ui/d.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 34,
   "en": "%s to cycle weapon info",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/ui/impl/CargoTooltipFactory$2$1.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 35,
   "en": "Press %s for more info",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/ui/impl/CargoTooltipFactory$2$1.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 36,
   "en": "Press %s to hide",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/ui/impl/CargoTooltipFactory$2$1.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 37,
   "en": " of this type.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/ui/impl/CargoTooltipFactory$2.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 38,
   "en": "A limited production chip that allows a carrier's nanoforges to produce fighters, replacement parts, and related ordnance.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/ui/impl/CargoTooltipFactory$2.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 39,
   "en": "Fighters that return to a carrier - for example, after a bombing run - are relaunched quickly and do not require the full replacement time.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/ui/impl/CargoTooltipFactory$2.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 40,
   "en": "Replacing Combat Losses",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/ui/impl/CargoTooltipFactory$2.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 41,
   "en": "The replacement rate gradually goes down while the carrier's fighter wings are on average not at full strength, and is slowly regained otherwise. It goes down more slowly while fighters are ordered to regroup.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/ui/impl/CargoTooltipFactory$2.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 42,
   "en": "This wing is built into the hull - it can not be removed and does not cost any ordnance points.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/ui/impl/CargoTooltipFactory$2.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 43,
   "en": "You own a total of %s ",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/ui/impl/CargoTooltipFactory$2.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 44,
   "en": "fighter LPC",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/ui/impl/CargoTooltipFactory$2.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 45,
   "en": "fighter LPCs",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/ui/impl/CargoTooltipFactory$2.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 46,
   "en": "*Per unit prices assume buying or selling a batch of %s units. Each unit bought costs more as the market's supply is reduced, and each unit sold brings in less as demand is fulfilled.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/ui/impl/CargoTooltipFactory$3.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 47,
   "en": "All values approximate. Prices do not include tariffs, which can be avoided through black market trade.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/ui/impl/CargoTooltipFactory$3.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 48,
   "en": "Available",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/ui/impl/CargoTooltipFactory$3.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 49,
   "en": "Best places to buy:",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/ui/impl/CargoTooltipFactory$3.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 50,
   "en": "Best places to sell:",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/ui/impl/CargoTooltipFactory$3.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 51,
   "en": "Control-click to buy up all the excess, or up to your cargo capacity, whichever is lower.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/ui/impl/CargoTooltipFactory$3.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 52,
   "en": "Control-click to sell up to the deficit, or down to your cargo capacity (if over), whichever is higher.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/ui/impl/CargoTooltipFactory$3.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 53,
